NOTICE OF ELECTION
Perris Union High School District
November 3, 2026
NOTICE IS HEREBY GIVEN to the qualified electors of the Perris Union High
School District, located in the County of Riverside, State of California, that in accordance
with applicable law, an election will be held on Tuesday, the 3rd day of November, 2026,
in the Perris Union High School District, at which election there will be submitted to the
voters the following measure:
MEASURE
“AA”
"Without increasing current tax rates, to repair/
acquire/ upgrade/ construct classrooms, career
technical education/school sites and facilities to
support college/career readiness in math, science,
technology, engineering, and skilled trades;
remove hazardous materials where needed; and
improve school safety/security systems, shall
Perris Union High School District's measure be
adopted authorizing $187,000,000 in bonds at
legal rates, levying $20 per $100,000 assessed
value (averaging $12 million annually) while bonds
are outstanding, with citizen oversight, audits and
independent audits?"
Bonds Yes
Bonds No
NOTICE IS FURTHER GIVEN that arguments for and arguments against the
measure may be filed with the Registrar of Voters Office, 2720 Gateway Drive,
Riverside, CA 92507 no later than 5:00 p.m. on August 17, 2026.
NOTICE IS FURTHER GIVEN that the polls at said election will be open from 7:00
a.m. until 8:00 p.m. on the stated Election Day.
Dated: August 4, 2026
Registrar of Voters